== Effects ==
* Fully heals Isaac.
* Gives Isaac one Red [[Heart Container]].
* +0.2 [[Speed]].
* +0.5 [[Damage]].
* +0.5 [[Tears]].
* +2.5 [[Range]].
* +0.16 [[Shot Speed]].
* +1.0 [[Luck]].
* +6.9% {{r|Devil Room}} / {{r|Angel Room}} chance.
* +6.9% {{r|Planetarium}} chance.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Spindown Dice}}: Changes Sausage into {{i|Dad's Note}}, which, if picked up outside of its special {{s|Mausoleum}} / {{s|Gehenna}} {{r|Boss Room}}, simply fades the music out and does nothing. Additionally, Dad's Note cannot be further rerolled, neither via Spindown Dice or by other means of reroll.
* {{C|Tainted Bethany}}: Grants 12 blood charges.
* {{c|Tainted Lazarus}} / {{c|Dead Tainted Lazarus}}: Only the increased Devil/Angel Room and Planetarium encounter chance is shared between the two forms, not the stat-ups (referring to the [[Item Tags lazarussharedglobal|<code>lazarussharedglobal</code> item tag]]).
* Additional copies of this item do not increase Devil Room / Angel Room and Planetarium chance further.

