== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Sausage|Sausage]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', some of the stat numbers it gave were slightly different and instead of increasing the chance for certain rooms to spawn it would increase tear height.
* Unlike all other items described as "all stats up" such as {{i|Magic Mushroom}} and {{i|SMB Super Fan}}, Sausage legitimately does increase all stats, including [[Luck]], [[Shot Speed]], {{R|Devil Room}} chance, {{R|Angel Room}} chance, and {{R|Planetarium}} chance (which none of the other "all stats up" items increase).
** The increase in Devil Deal, Angel Room and Planetarium chance, 6.9%, is a reference to how the number 69 can be used as a double entendre.
* This item's sprite, costume effect, and item pool suggest that this item is also based on the double entendre of "hide the sausage".
* In the files, the costume for Sausage is called "costume_069x_sosig.png."
* Its ID number, 669, is also a reference to how the number 69 can be used as a double entendre.
* The item's sprite also looks like [[wikipedia:Saucisson|saucisson]], a dry-cured thick pork sausage typical of French cuisine, Kilburn's country.
** According to Kilburn (lead developer for ''Antibirth'' and ''Repentance''), sausages are his favorite food.

